#ASSERT `s 40(2A) the employer may require the employee to exceed the limit of hours in subsection (1) and to work on a rest day` `s 40(2A)(a) accident, actual or threatened` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- (3)
#ASSERT `s 40(3) the employee may work the hours in the day` 13 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 40(3) the employee may work the hours in the day` 13 TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
