-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
§ `s 41 Interpretation of "week" for purposes of sections 36, 38 and 40`
-- A week is 7 days from midnight on Sunday.  Sunday 1 February 2026 starts the week of 1 to 7 February.
#ASSERT (`s 41 the week that holds the day` (Date 4 2 2026))'s `first day` EQUALS Date 1 2 2026
#ASSERT (`s 41 the week that holds the day` (Date 4 2 2026))'s `last day` EQUALS Date 7 2 2026
#ASSERT (`s 41 the week that holds the day` (Date 1 2 2026))'s `first day` EQUALS Date 1 2 2026
#ASSERT (`s 41 the week that holds the day` (Date 7 2 2026))'s `first day` EQUALS Date 1 2 2026
#ASSERT (`s 41 the week that holds the day` (Date 7 2 2026))'s `last day` EQUALS Date 7 2 2026
#ASSERT (`s 41 the week that holds the day` (Date 8 2 2026))'s `first day` EQUALS Date 8 2 2026
#ASSERT (`s 41 the week that holds the day` (Date 8 2 2026))'s `last day` EQUALS Date 14 2 2026
-- a week across a month end: Wednesday 1 April 2026 is in the week of Sunday 29 March to Saturday 4 April.
#ASSERT (`s 41 the week that holds the day` (Date 1 4 2026))'s `first day` EQUALS Date 29 3 2026
#ASSERT (`s 41 the week that holds the day` (Date 1 4 2026))'s `last day` EQUALS Date 4 4 2026

